# WP-SRC-VELOCITY (167136e77): look-ahead by speed. Plane 9000002 (LookAheadTime 2 s, MaxLookAhead 500 m,
# Scripts/World/WPFly.lua: 125 m/s along +X for 8 s - a 250 m look-ahead -, then stops; Play
# starting and the two wheel steps spend ~5 s of its time before the first frame); the Player's source is switched off.
# The editor keeps its last view mode (it came up in Velocity: a black viewport) - the scenario sets Lit.
# The sources live in Main cells not loaded in Edit: the palette's "World Partition: Load All" first (as WP22-REST).
